Server init.

>> db := Maria-DB nyowani mugamuchiri: ['localhost'],
	zita-remushandisi: ['xo'],
	pasiwedhi: ['pass123'],
	zita-redhatabhesi: ['xobase'],
	batana.

>> maparamita-ekutsvaga := db mubvunzo: ['
	INSERT INTO book (id, description, price, rating) 
	VALUES (NULL, ?, ?, ?)
'], maparamita: ( Rondedzero nyowani ; ['abc'] ; 12.35 ; 6 ). # parameterized queries

{  maparamita-ekutsvaga ita-murairo. db simbisa. } bata: { :e db dzosera-shure.  }, tanga.

Zvabuda nyora: ['Can we insert? '] + ( maparamita-ekutsvaga insert-id > 0 ), mutsara-mutsva.
